  "sourceNotes": "Exact canonical rails and active finite contact fields are technical base only. Independently authored edge timbers, rounded iron ribs/plates, pale fasteners, sculpted exposed sheet and restrained native shallow details. No target image card, painted export, alpha/RGB repair or per-view adjustment. All four directnative2x frames remain exact atlas copies.",
